OL,3,GNEWSAAlan Carr's castle potting shed
OL,4,Aplan praised as 'positive and
OL,5,Apractical'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPlans by comedian Alan Carr to convert
OL,8,Fa potting shed at his Borders castle
OL,9,Finto a cafe and shop have been welcomed
OL,10,Fas "positive and practical" by a
OL,11,Fcouncil heritage and design officer.
OL,13,FThe Celebrity Traitors winner bought
OL,14,FAyton Castle earlier this year with a
OL,15,Fnew TV series planned on his attempts
OL,16,Fto turn the estate into a workable
OL,17,Fhome.
OL,19,FThe proposals for the potting shed and
OL,20,Fancillary buildings are the first to be
OL,21,Fsubmitted to Scottish Borders Council
OL,22,F(SBC) since the purchase.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
